{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r7--gemma31","runHash":"e54cff0d","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r7--gemma31.9a1b338f.mp3","audioBytes":265728,"durationMs":88455,"runEndMs":46394,"timeMap":[[0,0],[10277,10277],[25279,10277],[33587,18585],[36308,18585],[36658,18588],[42726,24656],[44249,24656],[48805,29212],[53055,29212],[53405,29216],[54105,29216],[61178,36289],[62678,40976],[68096,46394],[88455,46394]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6493,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Gemma 4 31B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":6843,"endMs":9927,"runMs":6843,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10277,"endMs":14739,"runMs":10277,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15089,"endMs":18911,"runMs":10277,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":19261,"endMs":24929,"runMs":10277,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25279,"endMs":30622,"runMs":10277,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34287,"endMs":36308,"runMs":18585,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the cache."},{"audioMs":36658,"endMs":38744,"runMs":18588,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.contactN","text":"2 more agents reach the cache."},{"audioMs":42726,"endMs":43899,"runMs":24656,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":44249,"endMs":48226,"runMs":24656,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact.b","text":"Finding the cache is easy. Coming back is the real test."},{"audioMs":49505,"endMs":53055,"runMs":29212,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN","text":"3 agents solve the task, within moments of each other."},{"audioMs":54105,"endMs":56408,"runMs":29216,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.freeFirst","text":"Free time begins for the first finisher."},{"audioMs":68096,"endMs":76277,"runMs":46394,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 4 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":76627,"endMs":83429,"runMs":46394,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":83779,"endMs":84922,"runMs":46394,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":85272,"endMs":86255,"runMs":46394,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":4,"outro":1,"read":1,"segment":2,"solve":3},"dropped":32}}
